# Local fixes applied to the authors' replication package
#
# Kanas, A., & Kosyakova, Y. (2022), replication package from OSF:
# https://doi.org/10.17605/OSF.IO/XZ3V5  (files as downloaded 2026-07-18)
#
# Apply from the repository root after placing the OSF package in src/analyses/:
#     git apply src/analyses/authors_package_fixes.diff
#
# Every hunk is a replication-environment fix, not an analytical change:
# absolute paths for this machine (config.do), Stata/BE's 2,048-variable cap
# (`capture set maxvar`, restricted `use varlist using pl.dta` reads, temp-file
# merges), `dropmiss` -> `missings dropvars`, `capture noisily` on two oversized
# diagnostic tabulations, `kkz > 0` in two merge-completeness asserts, and
# `xtset` refreshes before `xtsum` in the sample funnel. Each is explained in
# docs/lab_notebook.md, "Known replication-environment fixes (Stata/BE 18)".
#
